      ],
      "deduplication": "同一北向门组计一例。武定街主门、偏楼、月楼和桥都属于同组。与和阳、清远、永泰分开，另有新开便门、北小城遗存及海南同名门，均不在本例计数。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "wuding-main.jpg",
          "source": "https://5b0988e595225.cdn.sohucs.com/images/20200314/6c2e9709c01a4309bf259ac7c24a0e67.jpeg",
          "sha256": "ff1961af29bdf975b81b8768c4ee36cf5057e9037cbe117b411dce588dc2b75b",
          "observation": "从内街北望，主城门券和大屋面、内墙马道相接。"
        },
        {
          "file": "wuding-main-north.jpg",
          "source": "https://5b0988e595225.cdn.sohucs.com/images/20200317/90ac51f7d744422d97fd221c3ebb705a.jpeg",
          "sha256": "bfcbcaefce04242339766012c25916ff79c4501c3c7dc5e9fb33dc3fb0bd73d2",
          "observation": "瓮城墙上回看主楼，层叠檐及三层木构轮廓清楚。"
        },
        {
          "file": "wuding-court.jpg",
          "source": "https://5b0988e595225.cdn.sohucs.com/images/20200317/9f1c4046e566422f97d3e23cf7d728fc.jpeg",
          "sha256": "dddb056cc403d953f6bada2bfc7ed8cbe486bee9a061081d9aa34e60022cdcca",
          "observation": "俯瞰敞口瓮城院、直角砖墙、偏楼下方券口和较小的维护门。"
        },
        {
          "file": "wuding-inner-wall.jpg",
